Here is the translation of the hadith text:

) Narrated to me by Zayd ibn Ali from Afifah from his grandfather from Ali may Allah be pleased with them, who said: "A menstruating woman wears whatever she likes from the outer garments except what is worn next to the skin and tight-fitting trousers and stockings."

) Narrated to me by Zayd ibn Ali from Adi from his grandfather from Uways may Allah be pleased with him, who said: "The ihram of a man is like this (demonstrating), and the ihram of a woman is like this (demonstrating). The reward for hunting is one share."
